= Paul Lejeune-Jung

Paul Lejeune-Jung was one of the few high-profile catholics from the <span style="color: #3f7bc1;">**DNVP**</span> and a member of its moderate wing. He is an economist and a foreign policy expert, who advocates for increased supranational cooperation among European States.

- @eb_negotiation
- @lejeune-jung_foreign
- @economic_policy
- @organizing_catholics
- @root: Return to main

@eb_negotiation
title: Europabund Negotiations
subtitle: Lejeune-Jung is a proponent of European federalism.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0; europabund = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; eb_progress += 1

Lejeune-Jung meets with representatives of French farmers and industrialists to negotiate a common European market.


@lejeune-jung_foreign
title: Foreign Policy
subtitle: We can set our foreign policy.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if not dvp_in_government: The <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> is not in government. ?] [? if foreign_minister_party != dvp_name : The <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> does not control the Foreign Ministry. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and dvp_in_government and foreign_minister_party == dvp_name
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; foreign_policy_timer -= 8; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: foreign_policy


@economic_policy
title: Economic Policy
subtitle: We can enact economic policies.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if dvp_in_government = 0: <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> not in government: ?][? if economic_minister_party != dvp_name: The <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> does not control the Economic Ministry. ?][? if not economic_plan: We have not adopted any Economic Plan yet. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and dvp_in_government and economic_minister_party == dvp_name and economic_minister = "Lejeune-Jung" and economic_plan > 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; economic_policy_timer = 0; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: economic_policy


